 a bin, a chest or the wagon no longer opens the card. Press Q to look inside. The crosshair tip shows the name on one line and the key on the next. It names what E will do: talk, give, lead, settle, feed, take, put it in, manage, open, shut,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T23:31:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114027003","verified_at":"2026-10-21T09:16:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5006600-1846651706690063","game_id":"steam-5006600","kind":"announcement","title":"Mountainhall has a Discord now","summary":"The Mountainhall demo is part of Steam Next Fest this week, and I opened a Discord to go with it.Join the Mountainhall DiscordIt's where I post what I'm working on, and where I find out what's broken. If you play the demo, I'd love to hear how it went: #demo-feedback for anything that confused you, or what you wanted to do next #bug-reports for crashes and broken things. The pinned post there says which files to attach.#devlog for progress posts between now and Early Access Early Access starts o","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T12:52:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690063","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:18:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5006600-1842846814449686","game_id":"steam-5006600","kind":"update","title":"Update 0.34.0: casks, crucibles and cleaner panels","summary":"Wine stays in the cask until someone brings a bucket, alloys move out of the smelter into a crucible, and the panels stop cramming three facts into one line. Seven playtest findings ride along: the selected tool shows its name, the tunnel popup lines up, a stockpile or zone paint waits for OK, the sowing window groups crops by kind, the card title sits over its body, and a picker opens above the panel that called it. New A stockpile, zone or farm drag opens a popup before anything stands in the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-05T19:40:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814449686","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:18:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5006600":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T16:20:55Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T16:20:54Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5006600":"2026-10-26T16:20:55Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5006600":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T16:20:54Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T16:20:54Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T16:20:54Z"},"5079350":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T16:20:55Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T16:20:55Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T16:20:55Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5006600","app_id":5006600,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:16Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"1d0a1b3a29b3a155c17a3824812bd678acc1f11dcdbe93877027163a7448d1ed","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"The dwarves have chosen you. Will you lead them? A new land, a new start, and a mountain waiting to become a home. Dig it out from the inside, lead a colony of dwarves with lives of their own, and stand with them when the goblins come. Build a settlement, a fortress, a Mountainhall.","publishers":[{"name":"Deepmountain Studios"}],"developers":[{"name":"Deepmountain Studios"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":18008